ied\nI updated [`pyproject.toml`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/pyproject.toml) to add:\n```toml\n[tool.setuptools]\npy-modules = [\"app\"]\n```\nThis explicitly informs Vercel and `setuptools` that the application module is `app.py`, preventing auto-discovery on static folders.\n\n---\n\n### 🚀 Push the Fix to GitHub & Vercel\n\nRun these commands in your Command Prompt window to update GitHub and trigger automatic Vercel re-deployment:\n\n```cmd\ngit add .\n```\n\n```cmd\ngit commit -m \"fix: Specify setuptools py-modules in pyproject.toml for Vercel build\"\n```\n\n```cmd\ngit push origin main\n```\n\nVercel will immediately pick up this new commit and deploy cleanly!"}
